COMMENT ON TABLE public.contacts IS 'Represents how UserA (ownerId) sees UserB (participantId) - for example, A''s custom nick and block status for user B.
In application, having a contact with a user, without block status in any direction (because all contacts should have Records in both directions), means privileges to read each other''s profiles';


